<title>SOUTH KOREA: Asian Development Bank sees talks on N.Korea entry.</title>
<headline>Asian Development Bank sees talks on N.Korea entry.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Asian Development Bank (ADB) may begin talks this year with North Korea on membership in the Manila-based institution, an ADB spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Substantive discussions have not yet commenced. They may start in the second half of this year,&quot; Robert Salamon told a news conference in Seoul.</p>
</text>
